WEBVTT

00:10.740 --> 00:16.000
<b>Well, goodness. Sometimes,
I'm so brilliant, it frightens me.</b>

00:16.830 --> 00:19.600
<b>You're still my key piece, 
so don't let me down,</b>

00:20.220 --> 00:22.460
<b>Miss Hundred Faces.</b>

01:59.930 --> 02:04.930
<b>Heroes and Tricks</b>

02:01.200 --> 02:03.100
<b>Shinohara-kun, you waited for...</b>

02:03.100 --> 02:04.010
<b>Meow?</b>

02:04.720 --> 02:06.650
<b>S-Sarasa-chan?</b>

02:07.030 --> 02:09.690
<b>Wh-Why are you and
 Shinohara-kun together?</b>

02:11.880 --> 02:16.790
<b>Saionji's competing with Miss Hundred 
Faces to see who can beat me first.</b>

02:17.410 --> 02:19.620
<b>So we decided to team up for now.</b>

02:20.230 --> 02:21.920
<b>It wasn't really my idea, though.</b>

02:21.920 --> 02:24.400
<b>Hey, Kazami. Tell me something.</b>

02:24.680 --> 02:26.740
<b>That video of Tokoyo 
Academy getting clobbered...</b>

02:27.020 --> 02:29.300
<b>I could tell it really bothered you, too.</b>

02:29.290 --> 02:33.920
<b>Special</b>

02:29.290 --> 02:33.920
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

02:29.290 --> 02:33.920
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

02:29.290 --> 02:33.920
<b>The Hotly Anticipated New Superstar Appears\h\h\h!</b>

02:29.300 --> 02:33.920
<b>But when the footage aired, it came with 
commentary lauding Miss Hundred Faces.</b>

02:33.920 --> 02:37.010
<b>Why would Libra cover 
for a tyrant like that?</b>

02:37.670 --> 02:38.810
<b>Can you tell me?</b>

02:39.260 --> 02:40.580
<b>Meow...</b>

02:40.940 --> 02:44.430
<b>To defeat Miss Hundred Faces,
 we'll need Libra's help.</b>

02:46.150 --> 02:49.850
<b>I can't, meow! I can't get you two involved!</b>

02:54.480 --> 02:56.260
<b>Please don't underestimate us.</b>

02:56.260 --> 03:00.190
<b>I'm no pushover, and neither is he.</b>

03:01.040 --> 03:02.290
<b>Um...</b>

03:03.430 --> 03:06.580
<b>Fine. I'll tell you everything, meow.</b>

03:07.080 --> 03:10.340
<b>Miss Hundred Faces is 
an unauthorized player.</b>

03:10.340 --> 03:13.580
<b>She isn't affiliated with any academy
 and has no right to play.</b>

03:13.580 --> 03:16.590
<b>She's using a forged account, meow.</b>

03:16.870 --> 03:21.090
<b>It seems she has an ally on the 
ASTRAL management committee.</b>

03:21.610 --> 03:23.670
<b><i>That must be Kurahashi.</i></b>

03:24.080 --> 03:26.800
<b>Miss Hundred Faces' data 
is all over the place, meow!</b>

03:26.800 --> 03:30.140
<b>All sorts of settings have 
been rewritten to help her.</b>

03:30.140 --> 03:33.100
<b>She's a cheater with 
all sorts of advantages, meow!</b>

03:33.520 --> 03:38.110
<b>When I figured that out, I suddenly 
felt this huge weight of responsibility.</b>

03:38.620 --> 03:41.080
<b>If Miss Hundred Faces goes on to win,</b>

03:41.080 --> 03:44.120
<b>it'll be the biggest disaster in 
the history of Academy Island!</b>

03:44.350 --> 03:47.620
<b>But Libra will take the fall for everything.</b>

03:49.610 --> 03:54.110
<b>ASTRAL is supposed to be 
a fun, exciting event, meow.</b>

03:55.210 --> 03:58.160
<b>I wanted to make it thrilling for everyone,</b>

03:58.160 --> 04:02.400
<b>and I spent so much time at Libra, planning
 and thinking of ways to make it work, meow.</b>

04:06.140 --> 04:08.130
<b>Yes, I know.</b>

04:08.810 --> 04:12.640
<b>Sarasa-chan. I don't... I don't...</b>

04:13.020 --> 04:16.960
<b>I don't want Libra to be ruined 
by something this unfair, meow!</b>

04:16.960 --> 04:21.090
<b>I don't want the place I call home 
to be destroyed by this, meow!</b>

04:21.090 --> 04:24.690
<b>So, Shinohara-kun, Sarasa-chan, please...</b>

04:25.240 --> 04:28.290
<b>Please save Libra for me, meow!</b>

04:28.650 --> 04:29.660
<b>Sure.</b>

04:30.020 --> 04:33.930
<b>I'm the strongest on Academy Island, 
and she's the Six Star Empress.</b>

04:34.370 --> 04:38.160
<b>Someone like Miss Hundred Faces 
is no threat to us.</b>

04:45.000 --> 04:48.470
<b>Why do we have to sneak 
around hidden like this?</b>

04:48.790 --> 04:50.670
<b>W-We don't have a choice.</b>

04:50.670 --> 04:55.600
<b>During ASTRAL, we aren't allowed to 
have any contact with people from Libra.</b>

04:56.930 --> 04:58.490
<b>Uh, Master...</b>

04:58.490 --> 05:01.030
<b>Sh-Shinohara! What do you
 think you're touching?</b>

05:01.030 --> 05:04.100
<b>Huh? I-I'm not touching anything.</b>

05:04.100 --> 05:05.980
<b>But I totally felt something.</b>

05:07.900 --> 05:09.990
<b>I'm seriously getting mad here.</b>

05:09.990 --> 05:12.830
<b>It's not me! Maybe it was Himeji.</b>

05:12.830 --> 05:15.060
<b>Huh? There's no way Yuki would...</b>

05:16.100 --> 05:18.130
<b>This is different. It is beyond my control.</b>

05:18.550 --> 05:19.760
<b>Watch it!</b>

05:27.510 --> 05:32.140
<b>United Army List</b>

05:28.630 --> 05:32.060
<b>This is the United Army ability 
Miss Hundred Faces is using.</b>

05:32.390 --> 05:34.090
<b>It is rather terrible.</b>

05:34.570 --> 05:36.430
<b>She doesn't know where to draw the line.</b>

05:38.000 --> 05:43.000
<b>If Miss Hundred Faces comes in first, all the 
academies in her army will be tied for second.</b>

05:43.000 --> 05:44.270
<b>That is what this means.</b>

05:44.270 --> 05:48.420
<b>So there's a good reason 
for them to want to join.</b>

05:48.780 --> 05:50.370
<b>Makes sense.</b>

05:50.980 --> 05:54.480
<b>There are already seven teams 
attached to Miss Hundred Faces, meow.</b>

05:54.800 --> 06:01.040
<b><i>So Kururugi didn't just run away that time. 
She was trying to tie for second.</i></b>

06:02.070 --> 06:04.780
<b>Ew. I just noticed a name I hate.</b>

06:05.800 --> 06:13.310
<b>Shinra Academy</b>

06:05.800 --> 06:13.310
<b>Kirigaya Touya</b>

06:05.800 --> 06:13.310
<b>Suzuki Chinatsu</b>

06:05.800 --> 06:13.310
<b>Kawagoe Shigetaka</b>

06:05.800 --> 06:13.310
<b>Yamazaki Ayako</b>

06:05.800 --> 06:13.310
<b>Mizutani Saya</b>

06:06.240 --> 06:09.350
<b>The holder of the 
Black Star, Kirigaya Touya.</b>

06:09.350 --> 06:12.210
<b>He might be even more trouble
 than the Demon Maiden.</b>

06:12.210 --> 06:13.300
<b><i>Seriously?</i></b>

06:13.470 --> 06:14.300
<b><i>Oh?</i></b>

06:14.640 --> 06:16.310
<b>Kugasaki Seiran</b>

06:14.640 --> 06:16.310
<b>Genda Takemori</b>

06:17.460 --> 06:21.960
<b>It's a tough situation, but if we can bring 
the other academies together through Libra,</b>

06:21.960 --> 06:23.430
<b>we might recover.</b>

06:23.750 --> 06:26.880
<b>Miss Hundred Faces holds 
less than half of the total area.</b>

06:26.880 --> 06:31.700
<b>Which means, if all the other teams band
together, we still have a chance of winning.</b>

06:31.980 --> 06:34.690
<b>But how do we get the teams to cooperate?</b>

06:35.050 --> 06:36.680
<b>If Miss Hundred Faces wins,</b>

06:36.680 --> 06:40.700
<b>all of the teams not allied
with her will lose a star.</b>

06:40.960 --> 06:44.870
<b>Oh, that's right! 
And they'd do anything to avoid that.</b>

06:44.870 --> 06:47.260
<b>Including taking on Miss Hundred Faces!</b>

06:47.660 --> 06:52.470
<b>So, if I made a glorious return 
after being eliminated from ASTRAL,</b>

06:52.470 --> 06:54.560
<b>it'd fire people up, don't you think?</b>

06:54.560 --> 06:55.970
<b>It sure would.</b>

06:55.970 --> 06:58.620
<b>The crowd would go wild for
 a good comeback story, meow!</b>

06:58.620 --> 07:00.280
<b>It is a wonderful idea, Master.</b>

07:00.560 --> 07:03.270
<b>That's why I'm going to MTCG.</b>

07:03.960 --> 07:07.160
<b>If you clear the most 
difficult route in MTCG,</b>

07:07.160 --> 07:10.520
<b>you can get the Wild Card that lets 
you take part in ASTRAL again, meow.</b>

07:10.780 --> 07:15.190
<b>You only have tomorrow 
morning to clear that route.</b>

07:15.190 --> 07:16.790
<b>I wonder if that's long enough.</b>

07:17.220 --> 07:22.920
<b>Kazami, we don't have much time. 
What's the quickest way to win the Wild Card?</b>

07:22.920 --> 07:26.930
<b>You'll have to defeat the Sixth Assassin
 in the hidden quest, meow.</b>

07:27.340 --> 07:28.850
<b>The Sixth Assassin?</b>

07:28.850 --> 07:31.600
<b>An outside participant 
who's in middle school.</b>

07:29.010 --> 07:34.430
<b>The Sixth Assassin</b>

07:31.600 --> 07:33.390
<b>In middle school?</b>

07:33.390 --> 07:36.060
<b>Wait, do you mean Shiina Tsumugi?</b>

07:36.060 --> 07:38.610
<b>H-How'd you know that, Shinohara-kun?</b>

07:38.610 --> 07:42.040
<b>Oh, well, it's because... 
H-How do I explain this?</b>

07:43.250 --> 07:46.520
<b>So, you innocently bumped into a 
middle schooler after hours in the hotel,</b>

07:46.520 --> 07:49.450
<b>then spent the night with her? Huh.</b>

07:50.010 --> 07:53.450
<b>What a marvelously fast 
worker you are, Master.</b>

07:53.450 --> 07:55.940
<b>Would you quit trying to spin it like that?</b>

07:56.250 --> 08:00.940
<b>Anyway, Tsumugi-chan's 
the final boss in MTCG, meow.</b>

08:01.250 --> 08:09.510
<b>Still, I have to enter MTCG, defeat Shiina, 
get the Wild Card, then return to ASTRAL?</b>

08:10.540 --> 08:12.580
<b>Can you guys last that long?</b>

08:13.040 --> 08:15.360
<b>Do not worry, Master.</b>

08:15.360 --> 08:18.590
<b>Why are you getting cold feet now?
 That isn't like you.</b>

08:18.590 --> 08:22.090
<b>You don't need to worry about 
Eimei or Ouka being tough enough.</b>

08:22.450 --> 08:28.390
<b>Just concentrate on coming back to us
 as soon as you can, stupid Shinohara.</b>

08:28.390 --> 08:30.350
<b>That is very sly of you, Sarasa-sama.</b>

08:37.540 --> 08:40.520
<b>All right, then. Time we got started.</b>

08:40.790 --> 08:42.500
<b><b>The Next Day</b></b>

08:40.790 --> 08:42.500
<b><b>ASTRAL Fourth Day: Morning</b></b>

08:51.020 --> 08:54.840
<b>We're here, meow! This is the MTCG site.</b>

08:55.450 --> 08:56.550
<b>Whoa.</b>

09:02.760 --> 09:05.730
<b>I'll support you, just like we planned, meow.</b>

09:05.730 --> 09:07.760
<b>Right. Thank you, Kazami.</b>

09:07.760 --> 09:09.950
<b>Check your Device, meow.</b>

09:09.950 --> 09:10.550
<b>Hm?</b>

09:10.570 --> 09:15.900
<b>Strengthen</b>

09:10.570 --> 09:15.900
<b>Exchange</b>

09:11.050 --> 09:15.940
<b>The important things in MTCG 
are cards, quests, and coins.</b>

09:16.270 --> 09:20.400
<b>There are cards numbered one to nine, meow.</b>

09:20.400 --> 09:23.710
<b>Add them up and you get 
your familiar's level, meow.</b>

09:24.120 --> 09:29.380
<b>There are five quest stages. The goal for 
each one is to beat your opponent's familiar.</b>

09:29.380 --> 09:34.680
<b>In order to do that, you have to raise your 
familiar's level to match your opponent's.</b>

09:35.090 --> 09:37.480
<b>So it's a number-matching game.</b>

09:37.470 --> 09:43.220
<b>Strengthen</b>

09:37.470 --> 09:43.220
<b>Exchange</b>

09:37.720 --> 09:39.300
<b>That's right, meow!</b>

09:39.300 --> 09:43.220
<b>And to level up, you have to use 
"Strengthen" and "Exchange" on your cards.</b>

09:43.220 --> 09:50.230
<b>Strengthen</b>

09:43.660 --> 09:47.250
<b>Strengthen takes time, though, so watch out.</b>

09:47.250 --> 09:50.220
<b>I get it. So it's like you buy the numbers.</b>

09:50.520 --> 09:54.270
<b>So if you want to save time, use Exchange.</b>

09:54.270 --> 09:57.980
<b>Exchange is the easiest way 
to increase your level.</b>

09:58.880 --> 10:03.670
<b>If you add coins to your card and 
exchange it for someone else's,</b>

10:03.670 --> 10:05.990
<b>you can boost your level in a snap.</b>

10:07.230 --> 10:09.740
<b>So the coins compensate 
for the gap in the values.</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:14.380
<b>Purchase</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:14.500
<b>Purchase</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:14.500
<b>Purchase</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:16.010
<b>Skill Cards</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:16.010
<b>Set Up/Purchase</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:16.010
<b>Level Up</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:16.010
<b>Reward Up</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:16.010
<b>Disable Skill</b>

10:10.180 --> 10:15.640
<b>Then you have the skill cards. 
You can buy those on your Device, meow.</b>

10:14.380 --> 10:14.500
<b>Purchase</b>

10:14.500 --> 10:14.630
<b>Purchase</b>

10:14.500 --> 10:14.630
<b>Purchase</b>

10:14.500 --> 10:14.880
<b>Purchase</b>

10:14.630 --> 10:15.010
<b>Purchase</b>

10:14.630 --> 10:16.010
<b>Purchase</b>

10:14.880 --> 10:16.010
<b>Purchase</b>

10:16.010 --> 10:23.510
<b>Level Up</b>

10:16.010 --> 10:23.510
<b>Strengthen</b>

10:16.010 --> 10:23.510
<b>Exchange</b>

10:16.760 --> 10:19.340
<b>You can carry up to five cards.</b>

10:19.340 --> 10:22.980
<b>Which means three number cards
 and two skill cards, meow.</b>

10:23.520 --> 10:24.530
<b>Whoo!</b>

10:31.300 --> 10:34.440
<b>Well, well. Isn't this amusing, Shinohara-kun?</b>

10:35.170 --> 10:36.280
<b>Who were you again?</b>

10:37.470 --> 10:42.160
<b>I'm the guy you kicked out of ASTRAL,
 Yuikawa from Ibara Academy!</b>

10:43.840 --> 10:47.330
<b>I bet you're also here 
aiming for a second chance,</b>

10:48.270 --> 10:51.320
<b>but I'm already on quest stage five.</b>

10:51.320 --> 10:53.470
<b>I'm about to clear this whole thing.</b>

10:54.700 --> 10:57.290
<b>It's impossible for you to catch up.</b>

10:57.700 --> 10:58.310
<b>Hey.</b>

11:00.500 --> 11:02.670
<b>Which card do you want?</b>

11:02.670 --> 11:03.300
<b>Huh?</b>

11:03.630 --> 11:05.570
<b>A four card.</b>

11:05.570 --> 11:11.370
<b>Right. In that case, I'll trade 
your one card and 100 coins for it.</b>

11:11.370 --> 11:14.900
<b>Hey! Don't just start talking
 to him like I'm not here!</b>

11:17.330 --> 11:20.750
<b>Just 100 coins? It'd really help, though.</b>

11:20.750 --> 11:24.300
<b>You're trying to beat her, right?
 Miss Hundred Faces.</b>

11:24.300 --> 11:25.580
<b>And what if I am?</b>

11:26.190 --> 11:31.460
<b>Our leader, Kururugi Senri, 
is always dependable.</b>

11:31.460 --> 11:34.840
<b>I'm sure she made the right choice 
allying with Miss Hundred Faces.</b>

11:35.560 --> 11:38.760
<b>But she had to do it
because we were too weak.</b>

11:40.300 --> 11:41.350
<b>I'm ashamed.</b>

11:42.620 --> 11:43.720
<b>That's why...</b>

11:44.260 --> 11:47.210
<b>I want you to return to ASTRAL.</b>

11:48.120 --> 11:51.000
<b>Please set Senri free.</b>

11:51.750 --> 11:54.240
<b>All of us at Tsuyuri want to get stronger.</b>

11:54.510 --> 11:56.720
<b>And to do that together.</b>

11:58.250 --> 12:02.470
<b>I see. Thanks for trading 
number cards with me.</b>

12:03.410 --> 12:08.750
<b>I can't say I'm doing it for Tsuyuri, 
but I <i>will</i> defeat Miss Hundred Faces.</b>

12:10.370 --> 12:12.740
<b>I understand. That's good enough.</b>

12:15.240 --> 12:18.840
<b><i>That sure helped.
I'm already up to Level 6.</i></b>

12:18.840 --> 12:19.520
<b>Meow!</b>

12:20.940 --> 12:23.670
<b>Now ya gotta look for 
a new opponent, meow.</b>

12:24.500 --> 12:27.000
<b>Libra's special search function.</b>

12:27.770 --> 12:30.510
<b>Who else is at Level 6 right now?</b>

12:33.720 --> 12:35.480
<b>Huh? Sh-Shinohara?</b>

12:35.790 --> 12:39.490
<b>You're kidding me. You're already 
challenging me? But you just got here!</b>

12:39.490 --> 12:41.020
<b><i>Begin battling.</i></b>

12:44.110 --> 12:46.610
<b>Our monumental first fight!</b>

12:46.610 --> 12:48.750
<b>We're gonna getcha, meow!</b>

12:48.750 --> 12:50.490
<b>Meow!</b>

12:55.500 --> 13:00.550
<b>Level Up</b>

12:55.500 --> 13:00.550
<b>Reward Up</b>

12:56.180 --> 12:57.710
<b><i>It is your turn.</i></b>

12:58.170 --> 13:03.250
<b>What card will the opponent use to 
change his numbers? Ya gotta anticipate it!</b>

13:03.260 --> 13:06.010
<b>Reward Up</b>

13:03.260 --> 13:06.470
<b>Level Up</b>

13:03.820 --> 13:05.800
<b><i>First, I'll use Reward Up.</i></b>

13:07.310 --> 13:08.770
<b><i>It is your opponent's turn.</i></b>

13:09.280 --> 13:12.760
<b><i>He's probably going to use Level Up.</i></b>

13:12.770 --> 13:19.480
<b>Level Up</b>

13:13.770 --> 13:15.470
<b><i>It is your turn.</i></b>

13:16.190 --> 13:18.870
<b><i>I'll use Level Up to change my numbers, too.</i></b>

13:20.910 --> 13:22.270
<b><i>Reveal phase.</i></b>

13:29.020 --> 13:32.290
<b>We're the same level. I win.</b>

13:32.690 --> 13:33.790
<b>What the...</b>

13:38.170 --> 13:41.300
<b><i>Game over. The challenger wins.</i></b>

13:41.300 --> 13:43.300
<b>Quest</b>

13:41.300 --> 13:43.300
<b>Quest Progress</b>

13:41.300 --> 13:43.300
<b>Next Target</b>

13:41.300 --> 13:43.300
<b>Level</b>

13:41.810 --> 13:42.830
<b><i>All right.</i></b>

13:43.700 --> 13:47.010
<b><i>If I'm gonna speedrun this,
 I'll need lots of coins.</i></b>

13:47.940 --> 13:49.970
<b><i>Guess it's time I made some serious moves.</i></b>

13:56.660 --> 14:01.770
<b>Over there is an Adjuster. He can 
exchange your cards and coins, meow.</b>

14:03.210 --> 14:04.770
<b>I want to make an exchange.</b>

14:05.470 --> 14:07.660
<b>I'll give you a one card.</b>

14:08.870 --> 14:11.280
<b>In exchange, give me a Reward Up card.</b>

14:11.280 --> 14:12.410
<b>Huh?</b>

14:12.710 --> 14:14.990
<b>He's getting rid of a number card?</b>

14:14.990 --> 14:18.410
<b>How can he clear the game if he 
doesn't have enough number cards?</b>

14:19.410 --> 14:21.910
<b>Are you in your right mind?</b>

14:22.190 --> 14:24.120
<b>Yeah. Do it.</b>

14:25.580 --> 14:26.910
<b>Very well.</b>

14:27.370 --> 14:31.420
<b>The exchange rate between the 
one card and the Reward Up card...</b>

14:31.730 --> 14:34.920
<b>i-is 99,000 coins.</b>

14:34.920 --> 14:36.440
<b>Wait, 99,000?</b>

14:36.440 --> 14:38.060
<b>That's a huge amount!</b>

14:38.060 --> 14:39.600
<b>Is he serious?</b>

14:39.600 --> 14:41.920
<b>Sounds good. I accept the trade.</b>

14:41.920 --> 14:43.190
<b>Meow-sands!</b>

14:46.150 --> 14:46.940
<b><i>Good.</i></b>

14:46.940 --> 14:49.290
<b>He got dozens of hours' 
worth of coins in a snap?</b>

14:49.700 --> 14:51.780
<b>What's he planning?</b>

14:52.070 --> 14:57.370
<b>Th-That was amazing, Shinohara-kun! 
Nobody else would've thought of that, meow!</b>

14:57.370 --> 15:00.460
<b>Now you can exchange as 
many cards as you want, meow!</b>

15:02.820 --> 15:04.380
<b><i>After that...</i></b>

15:06.400 --> 15:08.700
<b><i>I progressed through the quests.</i></b>

15:10.970 --> 15:14.930
<b><i>And with Libra's help, I soon 
had three number cards again.</i></b>

15:15.320 --> 15:18.720
<b><i>I have to hurry and get them all up to nine.</i></b>

15:19.630 --> 15:22.100
<b>Shi-no-ha-ra-kun!</b>

15:26.040 --> 15:28.400
<b>We thought you might be 
wanting these about now.</b>

15:30.040 --> 15:32.570
<b>We've been increasing our 
numbers since this morning.</b>

15:32.570 --> 15:35.910
<b>Between me and Tatara-san, 
we now have two nine cards.</b>

15:36.390 --> 15:39.930
<b>Wow, guys. Are you gonna
trade them with me?</b>

15:39.930 --> 15:40.980
<b>Of course!</b>

15:41.940 --> 15:45.160
<b>And forget exchange rates. 
We're Eimei buddies, after all.</b>

15:45.490 --> 15:49.830
<b>If you can win here, Shinohara-kun, 
Eimei might be able to turn things around.</b>

15:50.380 --> 15:53.750
<b>I want to see that happen. 
So, please take them.</b>

15:54.080 --> 15:58.650
<b>Eimei's future is riding on it.
 Do your best in ASTRAL, Shinohara-kun!</b>

15:58.650 --> 16:00.680
<b>Yeah, I will.</b>

16:01.010 --> 16:04.910
<b>I'll keep that dream of yours 
alive from here on out.</b>

16:07.970 --> 16:10.260
<b>Thanks a lot, Tatara and Tsuji.</b>

16:10.780 --> 16:13.270
<b>It's cool. Good luck.</b>

16:14.470 --> 16:17.330
<b>Fight!</b>

16:18.650 --> 16:20.470
<b><i>Hiro-kyun! Hiro-kyun!</i></b>

16:20.470 --> 16:21.800
<b><i>Got a second?</i></b>

16:21.800 --> 16:24.960
<b>I was able to access 
Tsumu-Tsumu's personal data,</b>

16:25.170 --> 16:28.550
<b>but security's tight and 
I'm stuck on the last password.</b>

16:28.810 --> 16:34.670
<b>It should be the level she's set at, 
but that's gonna take a while to decipher.</b>

16:34.990 --> 16:37.550
<b><i>Hiro-kyun, can you 
squeeze it out of her sooner?</i></b>

16:38.150 --> 16:39.420
<b>Understood.</b>

16:40.450 --> 16:42.800
<b><i>Shiina's level, huh?</i></b>

16:49.980 --> 16:54.000
<b>Ah, Shinohara. You got pretty close.</b>

16:54.320 --> 16:56.990
<b>But now you get to stand and watch in shame!</b>

17:08.210 --> 17:11.760
<b><i>So you were in the MTCG, huh, mister?</i></b>

17:12.330 --> 17:16.500
<b><i>Shiina. So you were 
the final boss after all.</i></b>

17:17.480 --> 17:18.890
<b><i>Begin battling.</i></b>

17:20.850 --> 17:22.960
<b>It's on, final boss.</b>

17:25.520 --> 17:28.020
<b>Exchange</b>

17:25.520 --> 17:28.020
<b>Exceed
\hLimit</b>

17:25.520 --> 17:31.030
<b>Strengthen</b>

17:25.850 --> 17:31.020
<b>Your level is the number you get with a
double application of the skill Exceed Limit.</b>

17:28.020 --> 17:28.150
<b>Exchange</b>

17:28.020 --> 17:28.150
<b>Exceed
\hLimit</b>

17:28.150 --> 17:28.270
<b>Exchange</b>

17:28.270 --> 17:31.030
<b>Exchange</b>

17:31.970 --> 17:33.590
<b><i>Reveal phase.</i></b>

17:33.590 --> 17:34.780
<b>In other words...</b>

17:35.510 --> 17:38.100
<b>It's 33! Take that!</b>

17:41.270 --> 17:44.370
<b>That's a miss. A complete miss.</b>

17:44.370 --> 17:46.910
<b>I'm not as weak as you think.</b>

17:48.240 --> 17:49.030
<b>Huh?</b>

17:56.860 --> 17:58.300
<b>Bow-gwow.</b>

17:58.480 --> 18:00.810
<b>B-But that <i>can't</i> be right.</b>

18:01.550 --> 18:02.430
<b>Get him.</b>

18:02.430 --> 18:04.560
<b>Bow-gwow!</b>

18:13.170 --> 18:16.020
<b><i>Game over. The boss wins.</i></b>

18:19.300 --> 18:21.950
<b>Come on up, mister.</b>

18:37.670 --> 18:42.090
<b>I'm totally, <i>totally</i> gonna win this game!</b>

18:42.490 --> 18:43.770
<b><i>"Totally"?</i></b>

18:45.890 --> 18:47.470
<b><i>Are you really that sure?</i></b>

18:48.500 --> 18:51.100
<b><i>This game is just about matching numbers.</i></b>

18:51.740 --> 18:54.690
<b><i>If you only try to get a 
higher number, you'll lose.</i></b>

18:55.170 --> 18:55.980
<b><i>Which means...</i></b>

18:56.490 --> 18:58.760
<b>It's negative, isn't it?</b>

18:59.180 --> 19:02.530
<b>Your level is below zero.</b>

19:04.370 --> 19:05.790
<b>Oh, wow.</b>

19:06.670 --> 19:08.490
<b>You're totally right.</b>

19:09.020 --> 19:12.110
<b>My level is -99.</b>

19:12.110 --> 19:16.210
<b>Lloyd's a guard dog from hell, 
so my level got inverted.</b>

19:16.210 --> 19:18.980
<b>Huh. That sounds like 
something you'd think of.</b>

19:19.340 --> 19:21.090
<b><i>Kagaya-san, take care of it.</i></b>

19:21.800 --> 19:23.670
<b>Just what I was waiting for!</b>

19:23.670 --> 19:26.570
<b>Big Sis to the rescue!</b>

19:28.210 --> 19:29.580
<b><i>Begin battling.</i></b>

19:29.930 --> 19:30.840
<b>Here we go.</b>

19:31.110 --> 19:33.140
<b>Meow!</b>

19:35.210 --> 19:39.070
<b><i>Hiro-kyun, I'm done overwriting 
the data. You're good to go!</i></b>

19:39.070 --> 19:39.960
<b><i>All right.</i></b>

19:39.950 --> 19:45.530
<b>Exceed
\h\hLimit</b>

19:39.950 --> 19:48.040
<b>Level Up</b>

19:40.920 --> 19:42.360
<b><i>It is your turn.</i></b>

19:42.810 --> 19:47.610
<b>I'm going to use Exceed Limit 
on all of my number cards.</b>

19:48.930 --> 19:50.210
<b><i>Reveal phase.</i></b>

19:50.590 --> 19:51.780
<b>So with that...</b>

19:52.300 --> 19:53.930
<b>I'm at Level 30.</b>

19:55.240 --> 20:00.200
<b>Huh? But wait, I'm at Level -99.</b>

20:00.510 --> 20:04.210
<b>And I know nobody else
 can get to that number.</b>

20:04.510 --> 20:05.220
<b>Huh?</b>

20:05.860 --> 20:08.940
<b>Why is Lloyd at Level 30 now?!</b>

20:09.400 --> 20:10.470
<b>Bow-gwow?</b>

20:10.470 --> 20:14.920
<b><i>Because Kagaya-san hacked 
your level and changed it to 30.</i></b>

20:15.310 --> 20:16.310
<b>Teehee.</b>

20:17.040 --> 20:19.910
<b>And that's game, set, and match!</b>

20:20.370 --> 20:21.820
<b>Meow!</b>

20:21.820 --> 20:25.830
<b>Meow-ow-ow-ow-ow!</b>

20:23.760 --> 20:28.550
<b>Bow-gwow! Bow-gwow! Bow-gwow!</b>

20:35.440 --> 20:38.290
<b><i>Game over. The challenger wins.</i></b>

20:38.500 --> 20:40.360
<b>Awesome!</b>

20:39.240 --> 20:40.920
<b>Seven Star!</b>

20:40.360 --> 20:42.070
<b>Shinohara!</b>

20:40.920 --> 20:43.020
<b>Wow!</b>

20:43.710 --> 20:45.010
<b>Yes!</b>

20:45.010 --> 20:47.010
<b>I knew you could do it, Shinohara-kun.</b>

20:47.760 --> 20:49.270
<b>Wow! Just wow!</b>

20:49.560 --> 20:52.640
<b>You really <i>are</i> strong, mister.</b>

20:53.020 --> 20:56.440
<b>I'm so happy. I'm so happy.</b>

20:56.710 --> 20:58.930
<b>Things are getting even more fun now.</b>

21:00.220 --> 21:01.740
<b><i>Maybe I should just go for it.</i></b>

21:02.230 --> 21:03.360
<b>Hey, Shiina.</b>

21:03.810 --> 21:06.050
<b>You're Miss Hundred Faces, aren't you?</b>

21:09.770 --> 21:13.900
<b>That's right. I'm Miss Hundred Faces, mister.</b>

21:14.420 --> 21:16.890
<b>Next time, let's compete in ASTRAL.</b>

21:16.890 --> 21:20.920
<b>Let's play a whole bunch of 
games and finish things off!</b>

21:23.710 --> 21:26.980
<b>From here on out, things are gonna get real.</b>

21:29.770 --> 21:32.840
<b><i>The person pulling the strings 
really was Kurahashi Mikado.</i></b>

21:32.840 --> 21:34.950
<b><i>I gotta hurry back to ASTRAL.</i></b>

21:36.930 --> 21:37.870
<b><i>Yes!</i></b>

21:38.660 --> 21:39.840
<b><i>I made it!</i></b>

21:40.450 --> 21:41.790
<b>Shinohara-kun!</b>

21:46.440 --> 21:47.710
<b><i>Yo, guys.</i></b>

21:49.460 --> 21:50.780
<b>Can you hear me?</b>

21:51.640 --> 21:52.720
<b><i>It's me.</i></b>

21:53.870 --> 21:56.370
<b><i>The fastest person ever
 to get to Seven Stars...</i></b>

21:56.730 --> 21:58.340
<b>Shinohara Hiroto.</b>

21:59.200 --> 22:01.200
<b><i>Wh-What's happening?</i></b>

22:01.200 --> 22:03.060
<b><i>Why's Shinohara Hiroto here?</i></b>

22:03.060 --> 22:04.700
<b><i>Is he making a comeback?</i></b>

22:05.870 --> 22:09.650
<b>I won the Wild Card in MTCG.</b>

22:10.500 --> 22:13.690
<b><i>So now I can play in ASTRAL again.</i></b>

22:14.640 --> 22:17.520
<b>I also learned something interesting.</b>

22:18.110 --> 22:20.610
<b>Miss Hundred Faces isn't even a player.</b>

22:21.690 --> 22:25.390
<b><i>She's just an enemy character 
the admins threw in.</i></b>

22:25.730 --> 22:29.420
<b>She's a gimmick to make
 the game more exciting.</b>

22:29.960 --> 22:33.100
<b>All of you are the top players 
from your academies.</b>

22:33.500 --> 22:35.800
<b>I know you have some stars, too.</b>

22:37.240 --> 22:40.050
<b>Are you gonna let some enemy 
character make fools of you?</b>

22:40.050 --> 22:41.410
<b>Do you want to be humiliated?</b>

22:42.270 --> 22:45.350
<b>I realize the situation is desperate.</b>

22:46.150 --> 22:48.920
<b><i>It might seem impossible 
to turn things around now.</i></b>

22:49.750 --> 22:52.920
<b><i>But if you don't want to 
lose to a cheating villain,</i></b>

22:53.760 --> 22:56.170
<b><i>what do you say to 
combining all our forces?</i></b>

22:57.390 --> 23:01.940
<b>If we form an alliance, we might
get ahead of Miss Hundred Faces.</b>

23:02.640 --> 23:06.440
<b><i>And your leader will be 
the resurrected Seven Star.</i></b>

23:06.770 --> 23:09.820
<b>The strongest on Academy Island. Me.</b>

23:10.910 --> 23:16.400
<b>If your team wants to join the alliance, 
make a Truce Agreement with Eimei Academy.</b>

23:17.200 --> 23:18.960
<b><i>I-It isn't over yet.</i></b>

23:18.960 --> 23:20.250
<b><i>We can't give up now!</i></b>

23:20.250 --> 23:22.380
<b><i>With the Seven Star on our side...</i></b>

23:22.290 --> 23:24.460
<b>Truce Agreement</b>

23:22.960 --> 23:24.460
<b>Truce Agreement</b>

23:24.890 --> 23:26.460
<b>Meow!</b>

23:25.780 --> 23:27.470
<b>They're all getting it.</b>

23:31.430 --> 23:33.470
<b>Alliance Formed</b>

23:33.630 --> 23:35.580
<b>All right, listen up.</b>

23:36.630 --> 23:38.780
<b>Now we go on the attack.</b>
